    given-names: Walid
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-10
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Walid-Idrissi-Labs/SciHumanizer"
url: "https://github.com/Walid-Idrissi-Labs/SciHumanizer"
abstract: >-
  A skill that writes and rewrites English and French prose without the measurable habits of
  machine-generated text and verifies the result with scripts: a style gate calibrated on human
  writing by language, register and length, a fact ledger, and a length check that refuses
  padding.
keywords:
  - academic writing
  - machine-generated text
  - stylometry
  - French
  - agent skill
